       - θ₀ T / (aT T * P.L T)
           * (4 + 2 * Real.sqrt (((aT T * P.L T)⁻¹) ^ 2 * trG2 T) + θ₀ T / (aT T * P.L T))
       ≤ (Z.N0s T (2 * T) : ℝ) - D T := by linarith [hA]
